[ti:Midnight Jazz Glow (90s Version)]
[00:10.36][00:10.00]Neon glows soft on the bar top, ice cubes clink slow
[00:18.33][00:15.00]Smoke curls thin round the saxophone, old records hum low
[00:27.09][00:20.00]You sat down right beside me, ordered a rye and coke
[00:35.59][00:25.00]Time slowed down like honey, every word you spoke
[00:44.89][00:30.00]The piano sways so gently, bass line walks real slow
[00:54.45][00:35.00]I don't care what tomorrow brings, just wanna let this feeling grow
[01:03.22][00:40.00]Oh this old jazz bar magic, we're dancing in the dim
